00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:49.920
And so we then caught up on the agent mode uh because that was sort of something that we could do on top of even the open AI models.

17
00:01:49.920 --> 00:02:00.000
But then the thing that hit us was obviously uh great work with that Anthropic did uh with their model, uh, which then truly made the CLI as a form factor uh.

