00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:49.840
So, Wes, given all that, why do you want to say that actually there is consciousness, your proto-consciousness at all these different points?

97
00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:57.040
Because I think Dylan expanded my point well that it would just make consciousness crazy all over the place.

98
00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:07.320
It would make us not no longer explaining why we humans with our subjectivity and ability to introspect and all that stuff, you're not explaining that anymore if you make it so wide.

99
00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.240
