100
00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:17.000
Well, I don't want to make it so wide as to to say every component of cognition is its own little consciousness.

101
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.720
We'd have to talk about where we do that.

102
00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.320
So I'd be inclined, right?

103
00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.840
So the pre-conscious feeling on my leg, right?

104
00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:37.240
That little pre-conscious packet, as it seemed to be called by Dennett and others in the in the reading that we did, that hasn't gotten into the global workspace yet and therefore isn't conscious on their terms.

105
00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:46.920
Well, it's kind of weird because when I do experience it, when I do pay suddenly pay attention to that feeling, it's not like the feeling wasn't there and now it's here, right?

